        "issue": "The plan preserves all required disclosures and no unsupported guidance, but the validation aggregation lists support and coverage thresholds, critical-claim checks, and a derived missingness value without explicitly requiring required_disclosures_complete=true, missingness_correct=true, or no unsupported guidance for a report to pass. A noncritical omitted disclosure could therefore appear to pass the listed numeric gates.",
